OL,3,GNEWSAParade to commemorate 9/11 Cornish
OL,4,Ahero
OL,5,
OL,6,FA parade and ceremony are taking place
OL,7,Fto honour a Cornish hero who died
OL,8,Fsaving thousands of lives during the
OL,9,F9/11 World Trade Center attacks in New
OL,10,FYork, 25 years ago.
OL,12,FRick Rescorla was head of security for
OL,13,FMorgan Stanley and was working in the
OL,14,FSouth Tower on 11 September 2001. He
OL,15,Fevacuated more than 2,500 people before
OL,16,Freturning inside. His body was never
OL,17,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
