OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAParade to commemorate 9/11 Cornish
OL,4,Ahero
OL,5,
OL,6,FChildren from Hayle's Penpol Primary
OL,7,FSchool, where Rescorla was a former
OL,8,Fpupil, are taking part in the parade
OL,9,Falong with members of the Royal Navy,
OL,10,FBritish Army, Royal Air Force and
OL,11,FParachute Regiment.
OL,13,FIt starts from the school at 13:00 BST
OL,14,Fand culminates with the ceremony at the
OL,15,FRescorla Memorial on Penpol Terrace at
OL,16,F13:30.
